msgid ""
"convert could not\n"
"be started."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo iniciar\n"
"convert."

msgid ""
"Could not write the\n"
"copy to convert."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo escribir la\n"
"copia que convertir."

msgid "Save failed"
msgstr "Error al guardar"

msgid ""
"Could not open the file\n"
"for writing."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo abrir el archivo\n"
"para escribir."

msgid ""
"The file could not be\n"
"written completely."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo escribir\n"
"el archivo entero."

msgid "Open failed"
msgstr "Error al abrir"

msgid ""
"convert is not on\n"
"this card."
msgstr ""
"convert no está en\n"
"esta tarjeta."

msgid ""
"The file could not\n"
"be opened."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo abrir\n"
"el archivo."

msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "Cambios sin guardar"

msgid ""
"This sheet has unsaved\n"
"changes. Save first?"
msgstr ""
"Esta hoja tiene cambios\n"
"sin guardar. ¿Guardar antes?"

msgid "Sheet full"
msgstr "Hoja llena"

msgid ""
"No room for another cell.\n"
"The change was not made."
msgstr ""
"No hay sitio para otra celda.\n"
"El cambio no se hizo."

msgid ""
"No room for more cells.\n"
"Some were not pasted."
msgstr ""
"No hay sitio para más celdas.\n"
"Algunas no se pegaron."

msgid "Fill"
msgstr "Rellenar"

msgid ""
"Too much to fill\n"
"at once."
msgstr ""
"Demasiado que rellenar\n"
"de una vez."

msgid ""
"No room for more cells.\n"
"Some were not filled."
msgstr ""
"No hay sitio para más celdas.\n"
"Algunas no se rellenaron."

msgid "Insert"
msgstr "Insertar"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Eliminar"

msgid ""
"That would push cells\n"
"past the edge of the sheet."
msgstr ""
"Eso empujaría celdas más allá\n"
"del borde de la hoja."

msgid ""
"No room: the sheet\n"
"is full."
msgstr ""
"No hay sitio: la hoja\n"
"está llena."

msgid "Format"
msgstr "Formato"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"G general  F2 fixed  ,2 1,000.00\n"
"%1 percent  $2 money  (digit: places)"
msgstr ""
"G general  F2 fijo  ,2 1,000.00\n"
"%1 porcentaje  $2 moneda  (cifra: decimales)"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"Not a format: G, F2, ,2,\n"
"%1 or $2 (any 0-8 places)."
msgstr ""
"No es un formato: G, F2, ,2,\n"
"%1 o $2 (de 0 a 8 decimales)."

msgid ""
"Too many formatted\n"
"ranges: 64 at most."
msgstr ""
"Demasiados rangos con\n"
"formato: 64 como máximo."

msgid "Width"
msgstr "Ancho"

msgid "Column width, in characters:"
msgstr "Ancho de columna, en caracteres:"

msgid "Chart"
msgstr "Gráfico"

msgid ""
"Select the table to chart\n"
"(labels in the first row\n"
"and column), then F5."
msgstr ""
"Elija la tabla del gráfico\n"
"(rótulos en la primera fila\n"
"y columna), luego F5."

msgid "Sort"
msgstr "Ordenar"

msgid ""
"Select the rows to sort\n"
"(all their columns), then\n"
"put the cursor in the key."
msgstr ""
"Elija las filas a ordenar\n"
"(todas sus columnas), luego\n"
"ponga el cursor en la clave."

msgid ""
"Too large to sort here:\n"
"sort fewer rows at a time."
msgstr ""
"Demasiado grande para ordenar:\n"
"ordene menos filas a la vez."

msgid "Go to"
msgstr "Ir a"

msgid "Cell (like B12):"
msgstr "Celda (como B12):"

msgid "Not a cell: A1 to Z999."
msgstr "No es una celda: A1 a Z999."

msgid "Find"
msgstr "Buscar"

msgid "Not found."
msgstr "No encontrado."

msgid ""
"A spreadsheet: numbers, text and formulas in a grid.\n"
"\n"
"Type into the cell; =A1*2 is a formula, =SUM(B2:B9) a range. Enter moves down, Tab right, Shift+arrows select.\n"
"\n"
"/, F4\tCommands: insert, delete, number format, width, sort, extend, goto, find, chart\n"
"F2\tEdit the cell\n"
"Ctrl+Z/Y\tUndo, redo\n"
"Ctrl+C/X/V\tCopy, cut, paste\n"
"Ctrl+D/R\tFill down, right\n"
"Ctrl+1\tNumber format\n"
"Ctrl+G\tGo to a cell\n"
"F3, Ctrl+F\tFind (again: the next match)\n"
"F5\tChart the selection\n"
"Alt+Left\tNarrow the column (Alt+Right widens)\n"
"Ctrl+N/O/S\tNew, open, save\n"
"\n"
"Functions: SUM AVERAGE MIN MAX COUNT ABS INT ROUND MOD SQRT POWER IF AND OR NOT PMT PV FV NPV VLOOKUP INDEX.\n"
"\n"
"Select a range to see its sum, average and count."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de cálculo: números, texto y fórmulas en una cuadrícula.\n"
"\n"
"Escriba en la celda; =A1*2 es una fórmula, =SUM(B2:B9) un rango. Intro baja, Tab va a la derecha, Mayús+flechas seleccionan.\n"
"\n"
"/, F4\tÓrdenes: insertar, eliminar, formato, ancho, ordenar, extender, ir a, buscar, gráfico\n"
"F2\tEditar la celda\n"
"Ctrl+Z/Y\tDeshacer, rehacer\n"
"Ctrl+C/X/V\tCopiar, cortar, pegar\n"
"Ctrl+D/R\tRellenar hacia abajo, a la derecha\n"
"Ctrl+1\tFormato de número\n"
"Ctrl+G\tIr a una celda\n"
"F3, Ctrl+F\tBuscar (otra vez: la siguiente)\n"
"F5\tGráfico de la selección\n"
"Alt+Izquierda\tEstrechar la columna (Alt+Derecha la ensancha)\n"
"Ctrl+N/O/S\tNuevo, abrir, guardar\n"
"\n"
"Funciones: SUM AVERAGE MIN MAX COUNT ABS INT ROUND MOD SQRT POWER IF AND OR NOT PMT PV FV NPV VLOOKUP INDEX.\n"
"\n"
"Elija un rango para ver su suma, media y cuenta."

msgid "Sheet help"
msgstr "Ayuda de sheet"

msgid "Find (F3 finds the next):"
msgstr "Buscar (F3 busca el siguiente):"

